cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Diophantine singularity and conditioning of shifted Kac–Murdock–Szegő matrices — Lean 4 formalization and interactive companion"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the companion record when available and the accompanying research preprint (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23486307)."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Charlie
    family-names: Dorsey
version: "3.4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Lean 4 formalization and offline reading and interactive
  companion to the independently archived shifted KMS research preprint.
  Includes pinned Lean/Mathlib source, 28 paper-result counterparts, proof
  navigation, a children's essay, and an original numerical explorer.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Kac-Murdock-Szego matrices
  - spectral conditioning
  - Diophantine approximation
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Diophantine singularity and conditioning of shifted Kac–Murdock–Szegő matrices"
    authors:
      - given-names: Charlie
        family-names: Dorsey
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23486307
    year: 2026
